<h2 style="font-family:'Montez',cursive;font-size:2rem;color:var(--primary);font-weight:400">Who I am</h2>
<p>My name is Vanessa. I am Brazilian, I have been living in Spain for 18 years, and I have always been deeply connected to sport and Thai massage.</p>
<p>I graduated in Nursing here in Málaga, where I currently live and run my own massage business. My knowledge of anatomy, together with several specialisation courses and a degree in Physical Conditioning and Sport, gave me the tools to build my own method, <strong>Thai Fusion Massage</strong>.</p>
<p>During my travels in Asia I had the chance to try different techniques and learn about many massage methods. I am especially grateful to have studied at Wat Pho, a renowned massage school in Thailand.</p>
<p>My passion for challenges led me to embark on this beautiful project, which I now share with you.</p>

<h3>YoguiFit Massage Studio</h3>
<p>At YoguiFit we help you improve your physical and mental health. A good massage has many benefits: it is not only about relaxing, releasing stress and easing pain; every type of massage also stimulates the immune system, making our body healthier and stronger.</p>
<p>Besides our massages in the Axarquía, we organise the <strong>Campus for massage therapists</strong>, a retreat-style specialisation course in Sports Therapy and Thai Fusion Massage.</p>
<p style="font-style:italic;color:var(--primary)">Love your body, because it is the place where you will live your whole life.</p>
